('rose-garden','Rose Garden','Nature',6,[4,2,3,5],'','A colourful garden made for unhurried walks and moments together.','The Rose Garden brings together flowering plants and open garden spaces. The reference highlights spring blooms, photography and walks with family or friends. Flowering conditions vary, so ask about what is in bloom when planning your visit.','Flower gardens|Photography|Family walks'),
