('rijal-castle','Rijal Castle','Heritage',10,[5,2,4],'Rijal Alma','Stone walls framed by the green folds of the mountains.','Discover Rijal Castle, a heritage stop included in the Aseer Explore collection. The reference photographs show stone structures in a mountain setting. Ask Abha Tourist Center about access and how to include the castle in your journey.','Stone architecture|Mountain setting|Heritage discovery'),
