('jabal-tha','جبل ثاة','Mountains',12,[0,2,4,1],'','A mountain adventure with sweeping views and a challenging approach.','This mountain destination offers views of the surrounding slopes. The reference notes a difficult approach with steep inclines and sharp bends. Ask the team about current road conditions, suitable transport and access before planning the journey.','Mountain views|Challenging approach|Outdoor adventure'),
('the-vineyard','The Vineyard (Grape Farm)','Farms',13,[3,2,6,1],'','Leafy pathways, grapevines, and an invitation to take the slow road.','The Vineyard offers a farm setting with fruit trees, plants, flowers and herbs. The reference describes it as a place to relax away from city life. Ask about seasonal grapes and current visiting arrangements.','Grapevines|Fruit trees|Garden setting'),
('thandaha-dam','Thandaha Dam','Dams',14,[4,0,5],'Near Khamis Mushait','Open water and quiet shores for a change of pace.','The reference describes Thandaha Dam as a peaceful stop near Khamis Mushait and mentions camping. Ask about current access, water conditions and permitted activities when planning time by the water.','Water views|Open landscape|Peaceful setting'),
('raspberry-farm-abha','Raspberry Farm Abha','Farms',15,[0,1,5],'Abha','A fruit-farm stop for a different side of Abha.','Raspberry Farm Abha is included in the supplied destination collection. Browse the reference photographs and ask the team about the fruit season, current availability and visiting arrangements.','Fruit farm|Seasonal produce|Farm discovery'),
('al-masqi-park','منتزة المسقي','Parks',16,[1,4,5],'','Green surroundings and seating areas for a relaxed pause outdoors.','The reference describes a park with seating areas. Its photographs show an open, green landscape and places to spend time outside. Ask the team about visiting and suitable stops nearby.','Outdoor seating|Green surroundings|Relaxed outing'),
('strawberry-farm-maski','Strawberry Farm Maski','Farms',17,[1,2,5],'Maski','Strawberries and a slower kind of day in Maski.','This strawberry farm in Maski is included in the reference collection. Ask about the fruit season and what is available during your planned visit.','Strawberries|Farm scenery|Seasonal visit'),
('strawberry-farm-sudha','Strawberry Farm near Sahab Park Sudha','Farms',18,[4,5,3,6],'Near Sahab Park · Sudha','Strawberries with a mountain view and a sunset worth staying for.','The reference highlights mountain views and sunset scenery at this strawberry farm near Sahab Park. Combine your interest in farms and mountain landscapes, and ask about fruit availability before visiting.','Strawberries|Mountain views|Sunset scenery'),
('atoud-dam','Atoud Dam Khamis','Dams',19,[1,2,3],'Khamis Mushait','A waterside pause in the heart of Khamis Mushait.','Atoud Dam is described in the reference as a dam within Khamis Mushait, with open views over the water. Ask the team about current access and how it fits into a day around the city.','Water views|City location|Scenic stop'),
('lavender-park','Lavender Park Khamis','Parks',20,[2,5,3,1],'Khamis Mushait','Space to play, walk, and spend time together outdoors.','The reference describes a spacious park with trees, children’s play areas and football grounds. It also mentions parking and places for groups to gather. Ask about current facilities before visiting.','Children’s play areas|Football grounds|Outdoor spaces'),
('mazra-thoth-aswad','Mazra Thoth Aswad','Farms',21,[2,3,4,6],'','Leafy paths, birdsong, and a gentle afternoon at the farm.','The reference describes a farm and resort with comfortable seating, birdsong and a fountain. It lists a café, restaurants and a children’s play area, making this a stop to consider for a relaxed family day.','Leafy pathways|Café and restaurants|Children’s play area'),
('rijal-alma-waterfalls','Water Falls – Rijal Alma','Waterfalls',22,[1,2,3],'Rijal Alma','Flowing water and rocky scenery for a refreshing nature stop.','The reference presents these waterfalls as a place to visit with family or friends and mentions vehicle parking. Water flow and access can vary; ask about current conditions before setting out.','Waterfall scenery|Nature stop|Rocky landscape'),
('the-summer-gathering','The Summer Gathering','Family',23,[2,1,3],'','Food, crafts, activities, and an evening full of light.','The Summer Gathering brings together activity areas, restaurants, cafés and crafts. The reference also mentions a horse track and decorative night lighting. Ask about its current operating season and available activities.','Restaurants and cafés|Crafts|Evening lights'),
('fog-walkway','The Fog Walkway (Dabab Walk Way)','Scenic Views',24,[3,1,2],'','An evening walk with mountain air and views into the clouds.','The reference highlights the Fog Walkway’s mountain scenery, fresh air and evening atmosphere. Clouds and visibility change with the weather, giving each visit its own character.','Mountain views|Walking|Evening scenery'),
