('silent-valley-hills','Silent Valley Hills','Mountains',26,[],'','A mountain destination for your next Aseer itinerary.','Silent Valley Hills is listed in the supplied collection. Ask Abha Tourist Center for photographs, access details and advice on including it in your journey.','Mountain destination|Journey planning'),
