('al-yanfa-village','Al Yanfa Village Tamniah','Heritage',30,[1,5,4],'Tamniah','Traditional village details and another perspective on the region’s heritage.','Al Yanfa Village Tamniah is included in the supplied destination collection. Its reference photographs show traditional architecture and village passages. Ask the team about access and how to include it in a heritage-focused day.','Traditional architecture|Village passages|Heritage discovery'),
